\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>:</b> <b>Wood</b> is common for use in <a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaffs</a>, <a href=\"/page/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">bows</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Ammo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammo\">ammo</a>. It is light, but its durability is low.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0004007500</span>4,007<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">3 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sands_of_Menechtarun\" title=\"Sands of Menechtarun\">Sands of Menechtarun</a></b>, Gnoll area: <a href=\"/page/Yurrugh_the_Swift\" title=\"Yurrugh the Swift\">Yurrugh the Swift</a>'s chest (Rare Encounter)&#160;; <br /> <a href=\"/page/Masei_Mkembe\" title=\"Masei Mkembe\">Masei Mkembe</a> sells for 625 <a href=\"/page/Antique_Bronze_Tokens\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Antique Bronze Tokens\">Antique Bronze Tokens</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Armor-Piercing\" title=\"Armor-Piercing\"> Armor-Piercing 9%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Armor-Piercing\" title=\"Armor-Piercing\"> Armor-Piercing 9%</a>:</b> Passive: +9% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Fortification\" title=\"Fortification\">Fortification</a> Bypass. (Fortification Bypass makes your attacks ignore a percentage of enemy Fortification.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\">Piercing 3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\">Piercing 3</a>:</b> The edges of this weapon have serrated edges, dealing an additional 3d6 piercing damage on each hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Doubleshot\" title=\"Doubleshot\">Insightful Doubleshot 2%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Doubleshot\" title=\"Doubleshot\">Insightful Doubleshot 2%</a>:</b> Passive: 2% <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Doubleshot. (Doubleshot is a chance to score an additional hit with a ranged attack.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Diversion\" title=\"Diversion\">Insightful Distant Diversion +4%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Diversion\" title=\"Diversion\">Insightful Distant Diversion +4%</a>:</b> +4% <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to decreased threat generated from ranged damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{background-color:#F8F8FF;border-color:#070700}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.sun>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Sun\"]{background-color:#FFFFC0;border-color:#00003F}.mw-parser-output span